    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="09617e51-a073-5beb-9092-888aa9000f43" activityNameId="2d62b0a2-99f4-5ffe-9c99-ee5367ad6e09" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Pipeline, natural gas, long distance, low capacity, onshore</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Pipeline, natural gas, long distance, low capacity, onshore
It is assumed that half of the pipelines are disposed in a discharge at the end of life, the other half stays in the soil. The life time of the pipeline is 40 years.;
UUID: 9adb57a2-2c3d-37d0-ab8c-c2832427313d
This dataset describes the infrastructure needed for a long-distance pipeline onshore with a capacity from average 0.8e6 Sm3/h gas including material requirements, construction and disposal. Helicopter flights for inspection are included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: The material quantities are calculated on the basis of the geometry of the pipeline (diameter 950mm, thickness 10 mm).
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: environmental report 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9adb57a2-2c3d-37d0-ab8c-c2832427313d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
